    {
      "@id": "https://cir4fun.eu/data#disposalinstruction_DMrHkm",
      "@type": "http://www.w3id.org/pdto#DisposalInstruction",
      "http://schema.org/description": "Separate steel panels, locks, and plastic components for recycling. - Steel frame and panels: recycle as ferrous metal. - Lock systems: dismantle and sort metal and plastic parts. - Plastic accessories: recycle according to local regulations. Dispose of non-recyclable residues according to municipal waste management procedures.",
